 ## Dépannage rapide
diff --git a/Team-Server.md b/Team-Server.md
index d6ea0e3..5cc5fac 100644
--- a/Team-Server.md
+++ b/Team-Server.md
@@ -94,8 +94,11 @@ A project is a git repository the server clones with its own SSH key
 
 Each person's token use per run and job, the days they used the server, sign-ins (refused ones
 too, with their reason, never the password) and the jobs they started. Never a prompt, code,
-typed text or file name. Token use and presence days are erased after
-`WORKPILOT_USAGE_RETENTION_DAYS` (365 by default, 30 to 3650). The page for your GDPR register:
+typed text or file name. **Page activity** (how often each person opens each page) is off until
+an organization's administrator turns it on in **Administration → Usage**, once the members are
+told; turning it off erases the counts. Each organization sets how long it keeps token use and
+presence (365 days by default, `WORKPILOT_USAGE_RETENTION_DAYS`) and page activity (183 days,
+`WORKPILOT_PAGE_ACTIVITY_RETENTION_DAYS`), from 30 to 3650 days. The page for your GDPR register:
 [docs/server-usage-data.md](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/blob/develop/docs/server-usage-data.md).
 
